dia and content."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"Take a byte out of this"},{"_key":"ce52a9ddbf62","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"Trends with friends billboard","asset":{"_ref":"image-9edbeaea5ad26c43b76a087aba1f9ef329d3a2f9-4600x3067-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}},{"_key":"d1b236d7fb5b","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"BBBB Graphic","asset":{"_ref":"image-1c1a5936cf20a3de0d5a4c99f0bb4a65ea67d1b7-1580x1580-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1020395939-2160p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}}]},"orderRank":"0|10001h:i","ourProcess":{"hideProcessButton":true},"slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"fresh-nutrition"},"thumbnailContent":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1083960299-720p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null,"vimeoId":"1083960299"},"thumbnailCover":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-b184f363a8151924db8be22922277b231070a1e4-2640x1760-webp","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1013658735","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/1931683717-4d151b697afb3055ccffecc2f1831303f2d27b9021079a11ef9a28f332b5279e-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1013658735-2160p.mp4","vimeoId":"1013658735"},"thumbnailExcerpt":"Cutting out costly middlemen with direct-to-consumer supplements.","title":"Fresh Nutrition","workHeroSection":{"backgroundColor":{"label":"Custom","value":"#dbe750"},"heroMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1013658735-1440p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null},"sectionContent":[{"_key":"bb821567dc26","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"6e99c0b6d0f90","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"As the trusted ingredient supplier for leading supplement brands, Fresh Nutrition knows a thing or two about quality. Now, they're cutting out the middlemen and making premium nutrition more affordable for everyone."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"servicesList":["Brand Strategy","Brand Identity","Packaging","Web Design","Amazon A+","Copywriting"],"websiteURL":"https://fresh-nutrition.com"},"workModules":[{"_key":"5985e90f5922","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"FN Process","asset":{"_ref":"image-79ad4fb0e5b72665fc4f84703c3b54d09095546a-1580x1580-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1013338794-2160p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}},{"_key":"b53b43167316","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"67144170b1f7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"97f2dcaf60770","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"After seeing strong sales during the vitamin-fuelled Covid days, Fresh Nutrition’s market footprint had started to plateau. They had a strong Amazon presence and great product. But a fragmented and confusing brand with little creative oversight meant that customer acquisition was dropping off. It was time for a refresh."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"Going back to basics"},{"_key":"6b6560488d54","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"FN Product with oranges","asset":{"_ref":"image-b971e6d0b6750bed0d3108fbdade04e043bdebfa-1580x1580-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"FN Design book","asset":{"_ref":"image-bd3978b94e62687e39f74d63204e30168778f4e4-1580x1580-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}},{"_key":"bfae9ced2d90","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"69fd2390cf58","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b1a29bb45f9b0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Utilizing our embedded partnership process, the Gimetry Studio team led Fresh Nutrition through a comprehensive repositioning and brand overhaul — including a complete rebuild of their AI Automation website. After aligning on a strategy, we rolled out copywriting, design, packaging and marketing strategy for 35+ flagship supplement products."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"A comprehensive rebrand"},{"_key":"d1967fc17747","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"FN Family Photo","asset":{"_ref":"image-cc57edbd8aeb77bbc2694d176a02f33bd0eb9e35-3200x1800-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}},{"_key":"ea1525d0b0be","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"FN Tote","asset":{"_ref":"image-404bdadf2da3827a6809cc4e8f039fe54a1d2a0a-2160x2159-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1013338821-2160p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}},{"_key":"f4a7d486daec","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"f2fff20b6e9d","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8dbc72d52f8c0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The rebrand gave the Fresh Nutrition team an ownable brand identity, built around their core strengths of direct-to-you simplicity and clarity. The scalable design system helps products stand out in a crowded marketplace, and a close working relationship between Gimetry Studio and product managers continues to enable rapid product innovation and quick go-to-market rollouts, helping the brand stay ahead of the competition."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"c5bfce26f991","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8fe70b9879760","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Now that’s Fresh."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"e18b987837a8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"2de9dce466c80","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"Bringing it all together"},{"_key":"8cf21a10023f","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","alt":"From us to you","asset":{"_ref":"image-b2fb023f4d93e81ddeb78a2976e1d86855d38c78-3200x1800-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}}]},